  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the four boxes be Box-1, Box-2, Box-3 and Box-4. Each of the box has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;red balls and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;blue balls.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/cd4298df-b141-419b-9626-33ce4672e39a-image.png\" style=\"width: 475px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;balls can be chosen in:</p><p>Case I - When exactly one box gives four balls</p><p>Case II - When exactly two boxes gives three balls</p><p>Required number of ways<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Number of ways in Case I&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math> Number of ways in Case II.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4320</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17496</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21816</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
